{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Turkish Vegetable Borek",
  "description": "A plant-based Turkish dish featuring roasted vegetables and lime juice, served in a talavera plate. This borek is perfect for a solo dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
