  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lime juice, olive oil, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the sliced eggplant, zucchini, and red bell pepper to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "Let the vegetables marinate for 15 minutes.",
    "Roll out the filo dough and cut it into 4 equal pieces.",
    "Place a few spoonfuls of the marinated vegetables onto one half of each filo piece.",
    "Fold the other half over the filling to form a triangle or square shape.",
    "Brush the tops with a little bit of olive oil and place on a baking sheet.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until the filo is golden brown.",
    "Serve the borek hot in a talavera plate."
  ],
